    "detailed_description": "<strong>Graffiti Battle, the adventure game.</strong> Play an aspiring graffiti artist on the road to fame.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">State of the game</h2>Graffiti Battle is in Early Access - this game is in active development.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935850/extras/572d2f5ca9e4456c1b728d90162ba1c6.avif?t=1711129081\" /></div><br>The Graffiti Battle game features:<br> <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Achievements<br></li><li>Character creation<br></li><li>Character progression<br></li><li>Crafting<br></li><li>Fame / Ranking<br></li><li>Painting graffiti<br></li><li>Questing<br></li><li>Tutorial</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Achievements</h2>The game progression is tied to unlocking related achievements.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935850/extras/c9b14a786895c0d7215fb532f42be0d0.avif?t=1711129081\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Character progression</h2>The character progression mainly depends on fame, granting new levels upon passing thresholds. <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Accumulating fame<br></li><li>Gaining skill points<br></li><li>Detailed stats system <br></li><li>Customizable outfits</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935850/extras/f240dab76b432726010db8a956dd8b30.avif?t=1711129081\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Crafting</h2>Use the crafting kitchen table at the player character home to cook rations, refreshments on the way around the world. The cooking ingredients can be bought at the local supermarket.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935850/extras/89890fc2a49a4823fe8537aec4e0851b.avif?t=1711129081\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fame / Ranking</h2>Compete with other players for rank number #1! Fame is earned by painting, or by completing quests. Styles have different rarities and types, the amount of fame depends on it, i.e. a common tagg grants less fame than a throw-up, or piece.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Painting Graffiti</h2>The Blackbook is a collection of all unlocked styles, ranging from simple Taggs, to quick throw-ups, and full fledged colorful pieces. To paint a style we first have to select it inside the Blackbook - click on it, and then depending on the spraycan color equipped we paint. <br><br>In order to paint, the player needs to stand in front of a surface - ideally in a 90 degree angle and equip a spraycan with enough color left. New blackbook styles are found, granted by completing quests, or by leveling. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935850/extras/e461c671757fab378ee3bd46536e91e9.avif?t=1711129081\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Questing</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935850/extras/572d2f5ca9e4456c1b728d90162ba1c6.avif?t=1711129081\" /></div><br>Interactions with the game world may result in quest offers, solving them yields rewards.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Tutorial</h2>The tutorial is the best way to learn the basic game functions.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935850/extras/a21818530cc192886d139b139f3384fa.avif?t=1711129081\" /></div>",
